\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Once again, dear Lord, we pray
\par For the children far away,
\par Who have never even heard
\par Name of Jesus, sweetest word.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Little lips that Thou hast made,
\par 'Neath the far-off temples' shade
\par Give to gods of wood and stone
\par Praise that should be all Thine own.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Little hands, whose wondrous skill
\par Thou hast given to do Thy will,
\par Offerings bring, and serve with fear
\par Gods that cannot see or hear.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Teach them, O Thou heavenly King,
\par All their gifts and praise to bring
\par To Thy Son, who died to prove
\par Thy forgiving, saving love.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

